  "details": "Reproduction steps:\n\n1. Open VRChat.exe\n\n2. Open Youreyes.exe /s\n\nWhile not necessarily a bug, this appears to be an oversight made by the developers. The Quest headsets use a unique color space which must be set otherwise colors will be inaccurate:\n\nhttps://developer.oculus.com/documentation/native/android/mobile-colorspace/\n\nThe standalone version of the game has much deeper oranges and reds, and slightly darker blues. This is indicative of an improperly set color space. This has been an issue since the launch of the game on Quest. \n\nI have attached images showcasing the differences in color between the Quest standalone and PCVR versions of the game with through the lens photos.",
